WEBVTT

00:00.694 --> 00:03.694
[light accordion music]
[轻快的手风琴音乐]

00:03.694 --> 00:09.160
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:09.160 --> 00:10.460
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

00:10.460 --> 00:13.694
[children laughing]
[孩子们笑]

00:16.527 --> 00:19.960
- I cannot believe I let you
talk me into this.
- 我不敢相信我让你
说服我做这件事。

00:19.960 --> 00:22.327
- Oh, come now, Mr. Squidward.
- 噢，来吧，章鱼哥先生。

00:22.327 --> 00:23.927
Catering is a great way for you
餐饮是您的好方法

00:23.927 --> 00:25.794
to make a little extra money.
赚一点额外的钱。

00:25.794 --> 00:27.227
And me to make a lot!
而我要赚很多！

00:27.227 --> 00:30.160
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

00:32.094 --> 00:34.227
- Any ideas?
- 有什么想法吗？

00:34.227 --> 00:35.294
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

00:35.294 --> 00:36.360
How's that?
怎么样？

00:36.360 --> 00:37.827
- Perfect, now get out there
- 完美，现在出去吧

00:37.827 --> 00:40.194
and feed the rest of those kids.
并喂养其余的孩子。

00:41.260 --> 00:42.894
[children screaming]
[孩子们尖叫]

00:42.894 --> 00:45.094
- They all seem so...
- 他们看起来都很...

00:45.094 --> 00:46.827
full of germs!
充满细菌！

00:46.827 --> 00:48.760
- Why, of course
they're full of germs.
- 为什么，当然
它们充满了细菌。

00:48.760 --> 00:50.360
They're kids.
他们是孩子。

00:50.360 --> 00:53.160
Why do you think I'm wearing
this full-body latex covering?
你为什么认为我穿着
这个全身乳胶覆盖物？

00:53.160 --> 00:54.060
[laughs]
[笑]

00:54.060 --> 00:57.527
- Okay, I'm going in.
- 好的，我要进去了。

00:57.527 --> 00:59.960
[inhales]
[吸气]

00:59.960 --> 01:02.127
Krabby Patty?
Krabby Patty?
克拉比·帕蒂？
克拉比·帕蒂？

01:02.127 --> 01:03.127
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:03.127 --> 01:04.227
- Ooh, ooh, oh,
- 哦，哦，哦，

01:04.227 --> 01:05.594
ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh.
哦，哦，哦，哦。

01:05.594 --> 01:07.594
- You're contaminating the food.
- 你污染了食物。

01:07.594 --> 01:09.494
Just pick one.
就选一个吧。

01:09.494 --> 01:11.094
- [sneezes]
- [打喷嚏]

01:13.327 --> 01:14.427
[laughs]
[笑]

01:14.427 --> 01:16.094
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:16.094 --> 01:18.994
I've been infected!
我被感染了！

01:18.994 --> 01:22.560
[children munching]
[孩子们咀嚼]

01:22.560 --> 01:23.994
- [vomits]
- [呕吐]

01:23.994 --> 01:25.560
[children screaming]
[孩子们尖叫]

01:25.560 --> 01:27.694
- Hey, kids, I'm a--
- 嘿，孩子们，我是——

01:27.694 --> 01:29.427
[children screaming]
[孩子们尖叫]

01:29.427 --> 01:30.527
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:30.527 --> 01:31.927
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

01:31.927 --> 01:34.060
- No, no, no!
- 不，不，不！

01:34.060 --> 01:35.694
- Hey, I'm not paying you
- 嘿，我不会付钱给你

01:35.694 --> 01:36.994
to play hide-and-seek.
玩捉迷藏。

01:36.994 --> 01:39.494
These children
want to be entertained.
这些孩子
想要被娱乐。

01:39.494 --> 01:40.827
Get down here.
下来吧。

01:40.827 --> 01:42.860
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:42.860 --> 01:45.827
- I want a balloon animal.
- 我想要一只气球动物。

01:49.727 --> 01:51.227
- Uh, um.
- 呃，嗯。

01:57.527 --> 01:59.294
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:01.027 --> 02:03.694
- What is it?
- A rock.
- 这是什么？
- A rock.

02:03.694 --> 02:04.694
- Whoa!
[screaming]
- 哇！
[尖叫]

02:04.694 --> 02:06.894
- Okay, birthday boy.
- 好吧，生日男孩。

02:06.894 --> 02:09.460
Take a swing
at that piñata, son.
挥杆
儿子，在那皮纳塔上。

02:09.460 --> 02:11.394
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:11.394 --> 02:12.394
- Oof.
- 噢。

02:12.394 --> 02:14.494
[laughs]
[笑]

02:14.494 --> 02:17.227
Don't hit nice old Mr. Krabs.
别打好心的老螃蟹先生。

02:17.227 --> 02:19.894
It's the piñata you want, son.
这就是你想要的皮纳塔，儿子。

02:21.560 --> 02:22.727
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:22.727 --> 02:23.794
[coins clinking]
[硬币叮当作响]

02:23.794 --> 02:24.927
- Me money!
- 我的钱！

02:24.927 --> 02:27.960
Do I look like
a piñata to you, boy?
我看起来像吗
给你一个皮纳塔，男孩？

02:27.960 --> 02:30.327
- Yes, get him!
- 是的，抓住他！

02:30.327 --> 02:32.827
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

02:32.827 --> 02:33.894
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:33.894 --> 02:36.894
[children cheering]
[孩子们欢呼]

02:36.894 --> 02:38.727
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:38.727 --> 02:39.927
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:39.927 --> 02:41.127
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:41.127 --> 02:43.560
Higher!
Go higher!
更高！
走得更高！

02:43.560 --> 02:46.360
[heavy metal music]
[重金属音乐]

02:46.360 --> 02:50.427
Uh, don't forget to take
your shoes off before bouncing.
嗯，别忘了带走
弹跳前脱掉鞋子。

02:50.427 --> 02:51.494
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

02:53.560 --> 02:54.927
[explosion]
- Ow!
[爆炸]
- 噢！

02:54.927 --> 02:55.960
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

02:55.960 --> 02:57.227
We have to
get out of here.
我们必须
离开这里。

02:57.227 --> 02:59.094
These children are menaces.
这些孩子是威胁。

02:59.094 --> 03:01.427
- They tore off my head.
- 他们扯下了我的头。

03:01.427 --> 03:03.294
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

03:03.294 --> 03:05.427
Maybe we should make
a break for it, Mr. Krabs.
也许我们应该做
休息一下吧，蟹老板。

03:05.427 --> 03:06.860
- I want my birthday cake.
- 我想要我的生日蛋糕。

03:06.860 --> 03:07.860
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

03:07.860 --> 03:09.194
- Cake, cake!
- 蛋糕，蛋糕！

03:09.194 --> 03:10.927
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:10.927 --> 03:13.360
- Come on, men, let's cheese it!
- 来吧，伙计们，让我们干酪吧！

03:13.360 --> 03:15.394
[screaming]
[尖叫]

03:15.394 --> 03:18.094
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

03:18.094 --> 03:20.527
- Oh, my, are you
the high-class caterers
- 哦，天哪，你是吗？
高级餐饮服务商

03:20.527 --> 03:23.694
I hired for an extraordinarily
large sum of money?
我受雇于一个非凡的
一大笔钱？

03:23.694 --> 03:24.827
- Yes!
- No!
- 是的！
- 不！

03:24.827 --> 03:26.260
- Yes.
- 是的。

03:26.260 --> 03:28.194
- No!
- 不！

03:28.194 --> 03:29.860
- Yes.
- 是的。

03:29.860 --> 03:33.394
- I do not have time
for this tomfoolery.
- 我没有时间
对于这种愚蠢的行为。

03:33.394 --> 03:37.227
I have a mansion
full of very high-class guests
我有一座豪宅
挤满了非常高级的客人

03:37.227 --> 03:39.560
waiting for very
high-class catering.
等待非常
高档餐饮。

03:39.560 --> 03:42.794
Are you they
or are you nay?
你是他们吗
或者你不？

03:42.794 --> 03:47.594
- Indubitably, madam.
We are your high-class caterers.
- 毫无疑问，女士。
我们是您的高级餐饮服务商。

03:47.594 --> 03:50.027
- But where are your tuxedos?
- 但是你的燕尾服在哪里？

03:50.027 --> 03:52.727
- Tuxedos?
Oh, just give us a moment
- 燕尾服？
哦，请给我们一点时间

03:52.727 --> 03:55.127
to suit up, me good lady.
穿好衣服，我好女士。

03:55.127 --> 03:58.194
- Now, where are we going
to get tuxedos from?
- 现在，我们要去哪里
从哪里得到燕尾服？

03:58.194 --> 03:59.727
- You.
- Hey, what are you--
- 你。
- 嘿，你是什么——

03:59.727 --> 04:01.094
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:03.594 --> 04:04.927
Ew.
呃。

04:04.927 --> 04:07.060
- Ready to serve you,
Miss Money Bags--
- 准备好为您服务，
钱袋小姐——

04:07.060 --> 04:08.860
er, I--I mean, ma'am.
呃，我——我是说，女士。

04:08.860 --> 04:12.260
- Very nice.
Here is your payment.
- 很不错。
这是您的付款。

04:12.260 --> 04:13.327
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:13.327 --> 04:16.927
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

04:16.927 --> 04:18.860
- Mr. Krabs, you can't
take that check.
- 蟹老板，你不能
拿着那张支票。

04:18.860 --> 04:20.860
We're not high-class caterers.
我们不是高级餐饮服务商。

04:20.860 --> 04:22.827
- We are anything we need to be
- 我们是我们需要成为的任何人

04:22.827 --> 04:24.927
for me to make this money.
让我赚到这些钱。

04:26.960 --> 04:30.327
Unless you wanna go back
to the kids' party.
除非你想回去
去孩子们的聚会。

04:30.327 --> 04:34.194
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

04:34.194 --> 04:35.094
all: No!
全体：不！

04:35.094 --> 04:36.127
- That's what I thought.
- 我就是这么想的。

04:36.127 --> 04:38.694
Then start setting up inside.
然后开始在里面设置。

04:38.694 --> 04:39.694
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:39.694 --> 04:40.994
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

04:40.994 --> 04:44.794
- This place
is so shiny.
- 这个地方
是那么闪亮。

04:44.794 --> 04:46.527
- Yeah, and so are the people.
- 是的，人们也是如此。

04:46.527 --> 04:48.994
- Oh, there's no way
these people are gonna think
-哦，没办法了
这些人会想

04:48.994 --> 04:51.227
our junk food is high class.
我们的垃圾食品是高档的。

04:51.227 --> 04:53.027
- Hmm, you might be right.
- 嗯，你可能是对的。

04:53.027 --> 04:56.027
SpongeBob, go find something
to fancy-up the food.
海绵宝宝，去找点东西吧
来装饰食物。

04:56.027 --> 04:58.460
- Fancy.
Got it, Mr. Krabs.
- 想要。
明白了，蟹老板。

04:58.460 --> 05:03.027
- Good, now I'll just get
the lay of the land around here.
- 很好，现在我就得到
这里周围的地形

05:03.027 --> 05:04.294
- I want my birthday cake!
- 我想要我的生日蛋糕！

05:04.294 --> 05:05.760
- Great Neptune's ghost!
- 伟大的海王星的幽灵！

05:05.760 --> 05:08.227
- I want my cake!
I want my cake!
- 我想要我的蛋糕！
我想要我的蛋糕！

05:08.227 --> 05:11.694
- Hey, kid, easy, easy.
Just calm down, will ya?
- 嘿，孩子，简单，简单。
冷静点，好吗？

05:11.694 --> 05:13.927
I got your cake.
- You did?
我拿到了你的蛋糕。
- 你做到了？

05:13.927 --> 05:15.594
- Yeah, yeah.
- 是啊是啊。

05:15.594 --> 05:16.694
Your birthday cake
你的生日蛋糕

05:16.694 --> 05:19.327
is right through here.
就经过这里。

05:19.327 --> 05:21.894
- Where?
I don't see any--
- 在哪里？
我没有看到任何——

05:21.894 --> 05:24.260
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:24.260 --> 05:26.094
Won't be seeing him again
any time soon.
不会再见到他了
很快。

05:26.094 --> 05:27.094
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:27.094 --> 05:29.694
- I. Want. My.
- 我想。我的。

05:29.694 --> 05:32.060
Birthday. Cake!
生日。蛋糕！

05:32.060 --> 05:33.727
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

05:33.727 --> 05:35.960
- I want my birthday cake!
- 我想要我的生日蛋糕！

05:35.960 --> 05:37.760
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

05:37.760 --> 05:40.360
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:40.360 --> 05:42.194
- What do you think
of this, Mr. Krabs?
- 你觉得怎么样
蟹老板，这个？

05:42.194 --> 05:45.060
I call it "Krabby Pâté."
我称之为“蟹肉酱”。

05:45.060 --> 05:46.494
Classy, huh?
优雅，是吧？

05:46.494 --> 05:48.594
Serve it while it's hot,
Patrick.
趁热吃吧
帕特里克.

05:48.594 --> 05:51.994
- SpongeBob, were those
jewels on the patties?
- 海绵宝宝，是那些
馅饼上的珠宝？

05:51.994 --> 05:54.027
- Yeah. You said
"Fancy-up the food,"
- 是的。你说
“把食物打扮得漂漂亮亮的”

05:54.027 --> 05:56.094
so I found some
shiny stuff for garnish.
所以我找到了一些
闪亮的装饰物。

05:56.094 --> 05:58.094
Got a whole box.
- What the--
拿到了一整盒。
- 什么是--

05:58.094 --> 05:59.794
[gasps]
SpongeBob, you can't
[喘气]
海绵宝宝，你不能

05:59.794 --> 06:02.760
just go around taking
people's precious jewels!
只是到处走走
人民的宝贵财富！

06:02.760 --> 06:03.960
- Well, I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
- 好吧，对不起，蟹老板。

06:03.960 --> 06:05.394
I was just doing
what you told me.
我刚刚在做
你告诉我的。

06:05.394 --> 06:06.494
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:06.494 --> 06:08.160
Don't worry about it.
Just tell me
别担心。
告诉我吧

06:08.160 --> 06:09.694
where you got them gems from.
您从哪里获得宝石。

06:09.694 --> 06:11.394
- Oh, upstairs.
- 哦，楼上。

06:11.394 --> 06:13.560
I went left, then right,
then double and triple right,
我向左走，然后向右，
然后右二右三右，

06:13.560 --> 06:15.560
then down, up, and right
18 more times.
然后向下、向上、向右
还有18次。

06:15.560 --> 06:17.360
Then do four somersaults,
a barrel roll,
然后翻四个筋斗
桶卷，

06:17.360 --> 06:20.127
jump backwards twice,
spin till you get sick...
向后跳两次，
旋转直到你生病...

06:20.127 --> 06:21.994
[gags]
And you're there.
[笑点]
你就在那里。

06:23.160 --> 06:26.194
- Okay.
- Fancy foods!
- 好的。
- 美味的食物！

06:26.194 --> 06:28.694
Get your fancy foods here!
在这里享用你的美味佳肴吧！

06:30.560 --> 06:32.427
[chewing]
[咀嚼]

06:32.427 --> 06:33.894
Delicious.
可口的。

06:33.894 --> 06:36.827
- I love delicious stuff.
My turn!
- 我喜欢好吃的东西。
轮到我了！

06:36.827 --> 06:39.460
[gobbling]
[狼吞虎咽]

06:39.460 --> 06:41.227
Yummy.
好吃。

06:42.794 --> 06:44.327
- I'll take a slice of that.
- 我要切一块。

06:44.327 --> 06:45.327
- Mine!
- 矿！

06:45.327 --> 06:46.194
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:46.194 --> 06:48.060
- Ouch!
- [barking]
- 哎呀！
- [吠叫]

06:48.060 --> 06:49.460
[gobbling]
[狼吞虎咽]

06:49.460 --> 06:50.460
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

06:50.460 --> 06:51.994
[plate shatters]
[盘子碎裂]

06:53.594 --> 06:55.160
- Who wants food?
- 谁想要食物？

06:55.160 --> 06:57.894
I'm a mindless drone
with food.
我是一架没有头脑的无人机
与食物。

06:57.894 --> 07:00.594
Working for the man.
Huh?
为男人工作。
啊？

07:00.594 --> 07:02.494
[light jazz music]
[轻爵士乐]

07:02.494 --> 07:03.860
[shimmering]
[闪烁]

07:03.860 --> 07:05.760
- Ooh.
- 哦。

07:05.760 --> 07:06.760
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

07:06.760 --> 07:07.760
- Here you go, princess.
- 给你，公主。

07:07.760 --> 07:09.394
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

07:09.394 --> 07:11.394
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:11.394 --> 07:13.327
- Whoa!
- 哇！

07:13.327 --> 07:16.027
- Let's do this thing.
- 让我们做这件事吧。

07:16.027 --> 07:17.394
[shrill squeaking]
[尖锐的吱吱声]

07:17.394 --> 07:18.794
Hey, where you going?
嘿，你要去哪里？

07:18.794 --> 07:20.194
[shrill squeaking]
[尖锐的吱吱声]

07:20.194 --> 07:21.227
Oh, down here.
哦，在下面。

07:21.227 --> 07:22.760
[shrill squeaking]
[尖锐的吱吱声]

07:22.760 --> 07:25.327
I never heard
of a marching quintet.
我从来没有听说过
行进五重奏的一部分。

07:25.327 --> 07:26.694
[squeak]
Uh, wait for me.
[吱吱]
呃，等我一下。

07:26.694 --> 07:28.694
Wait, wait, wait, wait for me.
Wait, wait--
等等，等等，等等，等等我。
等等，等等——

07:28.694 --> 07:29.694
[clarinet squeaking]
[单簧管吱吱声]

07:29.694 --> 07:31.760
Hey, hey!
嘿嘿！

07:31.760 --> 07:32.727
[clarinet squeaks]
[单簧管吱吱声]

07:32.727 --> 07:35.127
- All right, what did he say?
- 好吧，他说什么？

07:35.127 --> 07:38.527
18 rights,
then four lefts, or five?
18 项权利，
那么剩下四个，还是五个？

07:38.527 --> 07:39.427
Ooh.
哦。

07:39.427 --> 07:40.694
- I want my birthday cake!
- 我想要我的生日蛋糕！

07:40.694 --> 07:42.960
- [screams]
Oh, you--get off.
- [尖叫]
哦，你——下车。

07:42.960 --> 07:44.594
Enough of this.
[grunting]
够了。
[咕噜声]

07:44.594 --> 07:47.594
- If you don't get me my
birthday cake, I'll set off...
- 如果你不明白我的意思
生日蛋糕，我就出发了……

07:47.594 --> 07:49.560
- [screams]
- All these fireworks.
- [尖叫]
- 所有这些烟花。

07:49.560 --> 07:50.894
- Give me those.
- 给我那些。

07:50.894 --> 07:52.160
Young boy like yourself
像你一样的年轻男孩

07:52.160 --> 07:53.927
shouldn't be playing
with fireworks.
不应该玩
与烟花。

07:53.927 --> 07:55.994
They're too dangerous.
他们太危险了。

07:55.994 --> 08:00.427
- Gosh, no one ever cared
enough about me to explain that.
- 天哪，从来没有人关心过
关于我的事已经足够解释这一点了。

08:00.427 --> 08:03.160
It's like you're
my real father.
就好像你是
我真正的父亲。

08:03.160 --> 08:05.160
May I hug you?
我可以拥抱你吗？

08:06.027 --> 08:07.027
- Ooh.
- 哦。

08:07.027 --> 08:08.227
- Mr. Krabs?
- 蟹老板？

08:08.227 --> 08:10.860
- [screams]
Oh, uh, quick, in here.
- [尖叫]
哦，呃，快点，到这里。

08:10.860 --> 08:14.994
- Why, father?
Why?
- 为什么，父亲？
为什么？

08:14.994 --> 08:16.760
- Mr. Krabs?
- 蟹老板？

08:16.760 --> 08:18.460
- Um, yes, ma'am?
- 嗯，是的，女士？

08:18.460 --> 08:21.127
- Mr. Krabs, we seem
to be having some problems
- 螃蟹先生，我们似乎
遇到一些问题

08:21.127 --> 08:23.460
with the food service.
与餐饮服务。

08:23.460 --> 08:25.927
- Mine, mine!
- [gags]
- 我的，我的！
- [笑声]

08:25.927 --> 08:27.527
- Mine, mine!
- 我的，我的！

08:27.527 --> 08:30.027
- Uh, I'll be right down
to have a look.
- 呃，我马上下来
看看。

08:30.027 --> 08:32.194
Just need to
find something here.
只需要
在这里找到一些东西。

08:32.194 --> 08:33.527
All right, where was I?
好吧，我刚才在哪儿？

08:33.527 --> 08:37.560
Four somersaults
and a barrel roll, I think.
四个跟头
我想还有桶卷。

08:37.560 --> 08:39.960
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:39.960 --> 08:42.960
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

08:42.960 --> 08:44.660
[growls]
[咆哮]

08:44.660 --> 08:46.194
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:46.194 --> 08:47.194
- Patrick, no.
- 帕特里克，不。

08:47.194 --> 08:48.927
The food is for the guests.
食物是给客人吃的。

08:48.927 --> 08:51.594
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

08:51.594 --> 08:52.594
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:52.594 --> 08:53.594
[clarinet honks]
[单簧管鸣响]

08:53.594 --> 08:55.027
- What the--?
[inhales]
- 什么--？
[吸气]

08:55.027 --> 08:56.027
[exhales]
[呼气]

08:56.027 --> 08:57.360
- So then, I was all like--
- 所以那时，我就像--

08:57.360 --> 09:00.327
Oof.
Well, I never.
钱币。
嗯，我从来没有。

09:00.327 --> 09:01.794
- Food fight!
- 食物大战！

09:03.127 --> 09:04.594
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

09:04.594 --> 09:07.727
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

09:07.727 --> 09:09.760
- Oh, my.
- 哦，天哪。

09:09.760 --> 09:11.427
- Whoa.
[belches]
- 哇哦。
[打嗝]

09:11.427 --> 09:13.427
This must be the place.
一定是这个地方。

09:13.427 --> 09:15.994
Hello?
Ooh.
你好？
哦。

09:15.994 --> 09:17.327
Ooh-ee.
哦，呃。

09:17.327 --> 09:21.427
That is one big--
water bed?
那是一件大事——
水床？

09:21.427 --> 09:23.227
- Birthday cake!
- Dogfish.
- 生日蛋糕！
- 角鲨。

09:23.227 --> 09:24.794
- Hi, Daddy!
- Don't call me that.
- 嗨，爸爸！
- 别这么叫我。

09:24.794 --> 09:26.294
And stop jumping
on that water bed.
并且停止跳跃
在那水床上。

09:26.294 --> 09:27.394
You'll pop it.
你会弹出它。

09:27.394 --> 09:29.960
- Okay, Daddy.
- 好吧，爸爸。

09:29.960 --> 09:32.127
- Get over here.
- 到这里来。

09:32.127 --> 09:33.760
Why, you little--
- Hah, Daddy!
为什么，你这个小——
- 哈，爸爸！

09:33.760 --> 09:36.260
- [growls]
- Whoa, whoa, whoa!
- [咆哮]
- 哇，哇，哇！

09:36.260 --> 09:38.694
- Uh-oh.
- Whoa, whoa, whoa!
- 呃哦。
- 哇，哇，哇！

09:38.694 --> 09:39.827
[splash]
[溅]

09:39.827 --> 09:41.227
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

09:41.227 --> 09:42.760
- Stop it, everyone!
- 停下来，大家！

09:42.760 --> 09:46.094
You're ruining my par--
[exclaims]
你毁了我的标准——
[惊呼]

09:46.094 --> 09:49.694
Oh, no, you did not.
哦，不，你没有。

09:49.694 --> 09:53.127
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:53.127 --> 09:55.294
- Barrel roll,
four somersaults.
- 桶滚，
四个跟头。

09:55.294 --> 09:56.394
[water splashing]
[水花四溅]

09:56.394 --> 09:59.727
Look out, flood's a-coming!
小心，洪水来了！

09:59.727 --> 10:00.927
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:00.927 --> 10:02.794
- Nice doing business with you.
- 很高兴与您开展业务。

10:02.794 --> 10:04.694
- Come back here!
- 回到这里！

10:04.694 --> 10:06.727
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:06.727 --> 10:08.094
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:08.094 --> 10:09.327
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:09.327 --> 10:12.460
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:13.927 --> 10:15.294
[skidding]
[集材]

10:15.294 --> 10:17.127
Whoa!
哇！

10:17.127 --> 10:18.594
[fuse sizzling]
[保险丝滋滋作响]

10:18.594 --> 10:20.060
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:20.060 --> 10:21.060
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

10:21.060 --> 10:22.094
Oh, no.
哦，不。

10:22.094 --> 10:23.460
[rockets hissing]
[火箭嘶嘶声]

10:24.960 --> 10:27.360
all: Ooh.
全体：噢。

10:27.360 --> 10:29.194
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:29.194 --> 10:35.727
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:35.727 --> 10:37.860
- [cheering]
- [欢呼]

10:37.860 --> 10:39.160
My cake!
我的蛋糕！

10:39.160 --> 10:40.427
- My check!
- 我的支票！

10:40.427 --> 10:42.860
- My party!
- 我的派对！

10:42.860 --> 10:45.794
- [laughing]
- [笑]

10:47.727 --> 10:49.460
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

- [尖叫]